  "notes": "WORD FORMATION: From ⟦{寝|ね}る→寝る：00470_neru⟧ (to sleep) with reduplication for baby talk.\n\nUSAGE: Functions as a noun and as a ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ verb (ねんね⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ = to sleep).\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ねんね⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to sleep - baby talk)\n- ねんね⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{時間|じかん}→時間：00468_jikan⟧ (bedtime)\n- ねんねころり (lullaby phrase, similar to 'rock-a-bye')\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{子守|こもり}{歌|うた}→子守歌：19434_komoriuta⟧ (lullaby)\n- ⟦おやすみ→おやすみ：05206_oyasumi⟧ (good night)\n\nRELATED BABY TALK WORDS:\n- ⟦おてて→おてて：09104_otete⟧ (hands)\n- ⟦おめめ→おめめ：09105_omeme⟧ (eyes)\n- ⟦あんよ→あんよ：09106_anyo⟧ (feet/walking)\n- ⟦まんま→まんま：09108_manma⟧ (food)",
